      "raw": "[quote=\"Foote\"]\n\n&nbsp;\n<div class=\"bb-quote\"><b>Flib wrote:</b><br /><blockquote class=\"bb-quote-body\">Thanks. I picked up some mini expansions today at the local boardgame store, and didn&#39;t notice that they were for Villains. :)\n&nbsp;\n</blockquote></div>\nThere are no mini-expansions that are for &quot;Villains of the Multiverse&quot; or the Vengance format. This might&nbsp;cause confusion by putting it that way.&nbsp;Any mini-expansions are just that and are playable just like any normal game of SotM would be. Wager Master wasn&#39;t even released during th VotM cycle = D\n\n[/quote]\n\n&nbsp;\n\nYes, that is confusing. After all, it&#39;s a mini expansion that has &quot;villains of the multiverse&quot; written on it.\n\nI worried that, since Villains has a team mechanic, the villains mini expansion villains would be weaker of some sort, so that they&#39;d be too easy to beat if played as the sole villain in a regular game.\n",
