      "raw": "[quote=\"Foote\"]\n\n<div class=\"bb-quote\"><strong>Flib wrote:</strong><br /><blockquote class=\"bb-quote-body\">Foote wrote:<br /><blockquote class=\"bb-quote-body\">&nbsp;Flib wrote:<br /><blockquote class=\"bb-quote-body\">Thanks. I picked up some mini expansions today at the local boardgame store, and didn&#39;t notice that they were for Villains. :)&nbsp;&nbsp;</blockquote></blockquote></blockquote></div>\nThere are no mini-expansions that are for &quot;Villains of the Multiverse&quot; or the Vengance format. This might&nbsp;cause confusion by putting it that way.&nbsp;Any mini-expansions are just that and are playable just like any normal game of SotM would be. Wager Master wasn&#39;t even released during th VotM cycle = D\n\n&nbsp;Yes, that is confusing. After all, it&#39;s a mini expansion that has &quot;villains of the multiverse&quot; written on it.\n\nWhat? It says that?\n\n[/quote]\n\nI can confirm that no mini expansion says &quot;Villains of the Multiverse&quot; on it. The say &quot;Sentinels of the Multiverse&quot; at the top, and say whether they are a Hero, Villain, or Environment.\n",
