      "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/f/a8b319/{size}.png",
      "created_at": "2016-02-09T20:58:39.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Oooooh... Sorry, now I feel stupid. :/</p><p>I had the Villains expansion in my hands at the shop, so I guess I somehow thought about that, and read \"sentinels of the multiverse - villains\" with the villain mini expansion, thinking then that it was a mini expansion for villains of the multiverse... Sorry for the confusion.</p>",
